# Vendors' apt repositories, of which only the newest version of the named
# packages is taken: URL, suite, component, signing key URL, packages
# (comma-separated).
https://packages.microsoft.com/repos/code stable  main https://packages.microsoft.com/keys/microsoft.asc       code
https://packages.mozilla.org/apt          mozilla main https://packages.mozilla.org/apt/repo-signing-key.gpg firefox,firefox-l10n-pt-br
